cff-version: "1.2.0"
title: "umi-time-js: Reference JavaScript/TypeScript Implementation of Umi-Time"
abstract: >
  Official JavaScript and TypeScript reference implementation of the Umi-Time
  specification (published on npm as umi-time). Provides an immutable UmiTime
  class together with exact UTC-to-umi transformations, ISO 8601-compatible
  formatting and strict parsing, longitude-based local interpretation, and
  self-contained astronomical solar-geometry calculations defined by the
  Umi-Time specification.
authors:
  - family-names: Brannon
    given-names: Daniel
    affiliation: "Umi-Time Project"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24184935"
